        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(“Square Financial Services”) and with our third-party bank partners, we offer a growing number of Financial Solutions products that make it easier for sellers to manage cash flow and get faster access to funds.",
        "start_character": 17112,
        "end_character": 17323
      },
      {
