        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For instance, we hold an Australian Financial Services License issued by the Australian Securities and Investments Commission to provide non-cash payments in Australia, and we are licensed as an Electronic Money Institution to provide payments services and electronic money in the United Kingdom by the Financial Conduct Authority and in the European Union by the Central Bank of Ireland.",
